  "title": "From The Fog++",
  "description": "From-The-Fog is a horror modpack for Minecraft 1.20.1, combining From the Fog with other chilling mods for an immersive, atmospheric survival experience.",
  "body": "## From The Fog++\n\n[![Ko-fi](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fluxoah/Banners/main/available_on_modrinth.png)](https://modrinth.com/modpack/from-the-fog++/versions)\n\nDive into a world full of mystery, horror, and adventure! This **optimized modpack** introduces terrifying new entities like **Stalkers, Dwellers, the Man from the Fog, Herobrine**, and the **Cave Dweller**. Explore dark caves, encounter unique mobs, and experience a thrilling new dimension of Minecraft like never before.\n\n---\n\n### Currently Included Mods\n- **Man From The Fog** – Face eerie stalkers in the mist.  \n- **From the Fog** – Adds atmospheric horrors to your world.  \n- **Farmer’s Delight** – Expand your farming and cooking options.  \n- **Cave Dweller Evolved** – Encounter dangerous cave-dwelling mobs.  \n- **Alex’s Mobs & Alex’s Caves** – Add new creatures and underground biomes.  \n- **The Box of Horrors** – Unlock mysterious and terrifying surprises.\n\n---\n\n### Optimized & Upcoming Features\n⚡ **Optimized for smooth performance!**  \n⚡ **New versions are in development!**  \nStay tuned for more content, mobs, and features.  \n\n**Full mod list** is available on the version pages.\n",
